{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"12枚目シングル選抜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回とほぼ同じ位置になりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"経験したことをまだ外に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うまく伝えられていません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の期間は満足できる結果では"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかったと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それほど壁が高いのも実感しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん焦りました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まで以上にいろんなことを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"考え込んでしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"環境の変化にうまく対応できる力を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つけなきゃいけません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず、個人として確立させて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂に貢献したい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分にとっても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"グループにとっても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年はとても大事な期間です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この期間に選抜に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選ばれていることへの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有り難みを持って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しっかりと臨みたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人的には"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガールズルール以来の夏曲選抜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めちゃくちゃ嬉しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6枚目の期間は楽しかった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"という思い出しかないんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの頃の気持ちは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーで1年やってた時より"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素直だったなと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前に行きたいとか思ってなかったし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"入れるだけで嬉しいと思ってたし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと、そこまでグループと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真正面から向き合ってなかったから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なのかもしれないけど。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素直に嬉しい、楽しい時"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思う気持ちも大切にして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏を盛り上げていけたらいいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のセンターは生駒。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同い年として支えられる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"余裕もつくっていきたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というか、ちゃんと並ばないとな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり応援してくださる方が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"喜んでくれるのがいちばんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が喜んでると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に喜んでくれる人が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんいるんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気持ちを共有していきたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"味方がたくさんいるんだから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと楽しまなければ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46全員が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人の活躍ができるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私ももっとがんばります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全員で一つになって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良いライブを、作品をつくって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの人に知ってほしい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きになってほしい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12枚目の制作も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台じょしらくも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"映画もドキュメンタリーも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツアーもあります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"盛りだくさんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏の暑さに負けず、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばるぞーーー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援よろしくお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"成人を迎える前に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう一歩成長しなきゃ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2015/05/13/0022174/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2015/05/13/0022174/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"CUTiE 万理華の脳内#3"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊藤万理華"}],"source":"archive"}